# 1. Ignore everything recursively
*

# 2. UN-IGNORE the .gitignore file itself (required)
!.gitignore

# 3. UN-IGNORE the README file (required for good practice)
!README.md

# 4. UN-IGNORE the root directory (so we can see the folders)
!*/

# 5. EXPLICITLY UN-IGNORE the one project folder you want to keep
!01-link-short/

# 6. UN-IGNORE the content *inside* the project folder (required for the files to show up)
/01-link-short/*
!/01-link-short/**